{"4703660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "100 Second Soup Maker", "steam_appid": 4703660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;A 100-second showdown! The ultimate realistic dark hot pot simulator with over 700 ingredients!&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100-Second Hardcore Cooking:</strong> Boiling, seasoning, and soup adjustment... Master them all in under 100 seconds in this realistic hot pot simulator!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 700 Flavors of Chaos:</strong> From natto, venison, and foie gras to potato chips and cream puffs—the combinations are endless!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic Hot Pot Physics:</strong> Adjust the heat to change cooking times, watch sourness and aroma fade, and overload on MSG because &quot;umami&quot; is never too much!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Judgment of Fate:</strong> Get strictly graded on Taste, Aroma, and Volume. Foul smells and raw undercooking mean instant failure!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🎮 4 Endless Ways to Play</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🗺️ SOUP ADVENTURE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A culinary roguelike where you gather ingredients and survive events on an epic journey!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Journey of Evolving Fate:</strong> clear various events, and harvest new ingredients and seasonings along the way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adaptability is Key:</strong> Combine the limited resources gathered on your journey to create the ultimate hot pot within the 100-second time limit!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🎲 Random Hot Pot</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pure chaos with random ingredients picked from over 700 choices!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unpredictable Quick-Plays:</strong> Dive into a cooking challenge using only a completely randomized selection of ingredients and seasonings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wit and Instinct:</strong> Natto, foie gras, cream puffs... Out of these bizarre combinations, can you use the perfect heat and timing to secure a &quot;Pass&quot;?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🧪 Free Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No rules, no limits! The ultimate culinary lab to master every ingredient.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All Ingredients Unlocked:</strong> Experiment freely by tossing any of the game's ingredients and seasonings into your pot right from the start.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Research the Ultimate Recipe:</strong> Perfectly analyze the balance of the 5 basic tastes, meat/fish/vegetable synergies, and flavor concentration from boiling down.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>📖 COLLECTION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The ultimate database to crack the secrets of over 700 ingredients!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Comprehensive Details:</strong> Browse detailed descriptions and parameters for every single ingredient and seasoning in the game at any time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover Hidden Traits:</strong> Study each ingredient's 5-taste values and aroma profiles to gain the knowledge needed to dominate your next cook!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚠️ <i>Disclaimer: While reproducing these in-game recipes in real life might actually turn out delicious (or completely disastrous), the developer assumes absolutely no responsibility for the results.</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;A 100-second showdown! The ultimate realistic dark hot pot simulator with over 700 ingredients!&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100-Second Hardcore Cooking:</strong> Boiling, seasoning, and soup adjustment... Master them all in under 100 seconds in this realistic hot pot simulator!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 700 Flavors of Chaos:</strong> From natto, venison, and foie gras to potato chips and cream puffs—the combinations are endless!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic Hot Pot Physics:</strong> Adjust the heat to change cooking times, watch sourness and aroma fade, and overload on MSG because &quot;umami&quot; is never too much!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Judgment of Fate:</strong> Get strictly graded on Taste, Aroma, and Volume. Foul smells and raw undercooking mean instant failure!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🎮 4 Endless Ways to Play</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🗺️ SOUP ADVENTURE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A culinary roguelike where you gather ingredients and survive events on an epic journey!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Journey of Evolving Fate:</strong> clear various events, and harvest new ingredients and seasonings along the way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adaptability is Key:</strong> Combine the limited resources gathered on your journey to create the ultimate hot pot within the 100-second time limit!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🎲 Random Hot Pot</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pure chaos with random ingredients picked from over 700 choices!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unpredictable Quick-Plays:</strong> Dive into a cooking challenge using only a completely randomized selection of ingredients and seasonings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wit and Instinct:</strong> Natto, foie gras, cream puffs... Out of these bizarre combinations, can you use the perfect heat and timing to secure a &quot;Pass&quot;?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🧪 Free Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No rules, no limits! The ultimate culinary lab to master every ingredient.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All Ingredients Unlocked:</strong> Experiment freely by tossing any of the game's ingredients and seasonings into your pot right from the start.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Research the Ultimate Recipe:</strong> Perfectly analyze the balance of the 5 basic tastes, meat/fish/vegetable synergies, and flavor concentration from boiling down.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>📖 COLLECTION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The ultimate database to crack the secrets of over 700 ingredients!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Comprehensive Details:</strong> Browse detailed descriptions and parameters for every single ingredient and seasoning in the game at any time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover Hidden Traits:</strong> Study each ingredient's 5-taste values and aroma profiles to gain the knowledge needed to dominate your next cook!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚠️ <i>Disclaimer: While reproducing these in-game recipes in real life might actually turn out delicious (or completely di